  "finalSourceDelta": "The full compiler binaries used in end-to-end tests precede a one-keyword static inline adjustment. Native O0/O2 suites use the final source. O2 assembler output on both platforms confirms that no out-of-line call is added to the existing retain path.",
  "checks": [
    "A watched instance result reuses the original Context control and adds exactly one language reference. Explicit close expires its other aliases. Renderer retains a weak link, which returns null after native Context retirement.",
    "The runtime checks creator affinity, active native receiver scope and exact result policy. It does not wrap unregistered pointers or create a new native owner.",
    "The O0/O2 native runs each completed 1,000 same-root lookups with the next-allocation fault armed and unchanged allocation, free, and reallocation counts. Missing, out-of-scope, wrong-policy, and closed queries reported StateError.",
    "Generated code uses the direct native getter and a resident lookup. The protected native renderer scope also queries its weak link.",
    "The lookup takes a runtime lock and scans registered roots for a unique live match. No zero-overhead claim is made."
